OL,3,ABlack woman found hanging from tree was
OL,4,Adead before body was 'staged', police
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains
OL,8,Fdistressing details
OL,10,FPolice in the US state of Mississippi
OL,11,Fhave said that they believe a black
OL,12,Fwoman was already dead before her body
OL,13,Fwas "staged" and placed hanging in a
OL,14,Ftree.
OL,16,FThe disclosure was made in court by a
OL,17,Fdetective on Friday, who also said they
OL,18,Fbelieved Tasia Fortune, a mother of
OL,19,Ffour, had been killed in a dispute
OL,20,Frelated to drugs.
